      "action_statement": "Update postgresql-17 to 17.12-0 or later.",
      "status_notes": "PostgreSQL fixed CVE-2026-116327 (security_barrier view analysis can let a database user infer hidden values through a leaky function applied to a CASE test value or internal parameter) in 17.12 on the 17 branch: https://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2026-116327/. Checked every published build of this owner on amd64 and arm64: the server binary in 17.12-0 and in the build of Debian's 17.12-0+deb13u1 reports PostgreSQL 17.12, which contains the fix; the earlier builds, 17.11-1 and the build of Debian's 17.11-0+deb13u1, report PostgreSQL 17.11 and are affected."
